  <main id="main" class="freezing-page">
    <section class="freezing-hero"><div class="container-page freezing-hero-grid"><div class="freezing-hero-copy"><nav class="compressor-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="index.html">Home</a><span>/</span><a href="products.html">Products</a><span>/</span><span aria-current="page">Freezing Systems</span></nav><span class="eyebrow">Freezing Equipment</span><h1>Freezing systems built to preserve product quality at speed.</h1><p>Choose high-performance plate freezers and spiral IQF systems for food processing, seafood, poultry, bakery and prepared-food applications—designed around throughput, product handling and plant space.</p><div class="compressor-hero-actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="contact.html">Request a Consultation <i data-lucide="arrow-up-right" class="h-4 w-4"></i></a><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#freezing-technologies">Explore Freezing Technologies</a></div><div class="compressor-quickfacts"><span><i data-lucide="snowflake"></i>Rapid contact & IQF freezing</span><span><i data-lucide="package-check"></i>Product-quality focused</span><span><i data-lucide="factory"></i>Food-processing ready</span></div></div><div class="freezing-hero-image"><img src="assets/images/freezing-systems/packaged-iqf-spiral.png" alt="Packaged IQF spiral freezer"><div><span>Continuous freezing</span><b>Packaged IQF spiral freezer systems</b></div></div></div></section>
    <section class="compressor-intro section-pad"><div class="container-page compressor-intro-grid"><div><span class="eyebrow">Choose the Right Process</span><h2>Contact freezing and continuous IQF, planned for your product.</h2></div><p>The right freezer protects quality while meeting production targets. We help align freezing technology with your product format, handling method, capacity, available space and sanitation requirements.</p></div></section>
    <section id="freezing-technologies" class="freezing-technologies section-pad"><div class="container-page"><div class="compressor-section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">Freezing Technologies</span><h2>Two proven routes to efficient product freezing.</h2></div><p>Plate and spiral systems solve different production challenges; our team can help determine the right approach.</p></div><div class="freezing-card-grid"><article class="freezing-card freezing-card-large"><div class="freezing-card-image"><img src="assets/images/freezing-systems/tucal-horizontal-plate.jpg" alt="Tucal horizontal plate freezer"></div><div class="freezing-card-copy"><span>PLATE FREEZERS</span><h3>Direct-contact freezing for fast, uniform blocks.</h3><p>Plate freezers transfer cooling directly through refrigerated plates, delivering rapid, efficient freezing while helping retain product structure and minimize dehydration.</p><div class="freezing-family-list"><div><b>OceanBlue contact plate freezer</b><span>For packed fish, seafood, meat, vegetables, fruit and tray-packed products.</span></div><div><b>Tucal horizontal plate freezer</b><span>For loose, bagged or carton-packed food in uniform blocks, with bespoke station and refrigerant options.</span></div><div><b>DSI vertical plate freezer</b><span>For high-volume block freezing of food and liquids with double-contact freezing.</span></div></div></div></article><article class="freezing-card"><div class="freezing-card-image"><img src="assets/images/freezing-systems/packaged-iqf-spiral.png" alt="Spiral IQF freezer system"></div><div class="freezing-card-copy"><span>SPIRAL IQF FREEZERS</span><h3>Continuous inline freezing with gentle handling.</h3><p>Packaged spiral freezers move products on a continuous belt through a controlled freezing zone, enabling IQF quality, compact use of vertical space and lower product weight loss.</p><ul><li>For small to medium production capacities</li><li>Suitable for poultry, seafood, red meat, bakery and prepared foods</li><li>Packaged delivery and easy site installation</li></ul></div></article></div></div></section>
    <section class="freezing-selection"><div class="container-page condenser-selection-grid"><div class="condenser-selection-visual"><img src="assets/images/freezing-systems/tucal-horizontal-plate.jpg" alt="Horizontal plate freezer equipment"><div><i data-lucide="thermometer-snowflake"></i><span>Freezing process engineered around your product</span></div></div><div class="compressor-selection-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Engineering-Led Selection</span><h2>Start with the product, then select the freezer.</h2><p>Our engineers consider product shape, packaging, moisture content, throughput, freezing time, preferred handling method, available utilities and plant layout before recommending a plate or spiral system.</p><div class="selection-list"><div><i data-lucide="package"></i><span>Product format, dimensions and packaging</span></div><div><i data-lucide="chart-no-axes-combined"></i><span>Throughput, retention time and capacity goals</span></div><div><i data-lucide="ruler"></i><span>Site layout, hygiene and service access</span></div></div><a class="text-link-dark" href="contact.html">Speak with an engineer <i data-lucide="arrow-up-right"></i></a></div></div></section>
    <section class="compressor-cta"><div class="container-page compressor-cta-inner"><div><span class="eyebrow">Plan Your Freezing Line</span><h2>Need a freezing system designed for your product and production target?</h2><p>Share your application and our team will help shape the right equipment path.</p></div><a class="btn btn-primary" href="contact.html">Talk to Thermo-Care <i data-lucide="arrow-up-right" class="h-4 w-4"></i></a></div></section>
